    "description": "Creates a requirement and its first draft. Staff only. Document requirements are versioned config (same lifecycle as question sets: an ops lead makes, a different staff member approves in Change Requests, then it is published). `content`: `stage` (`assessment`, `submission`, `post_sanction`), `scope` (`segments`, `subSegments`, `categories`; empty = everyone) and `items[]` slots: `key`, `documentTypes` (any one of them satisfies the slot), `required` (default true), `minCount` (default 1), optional `when` condition on facts, and `label` / `description` overrides. A more specific requirement replaces a slot with the same key.",
    "body": {
      "mode": "raw",
      "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"assessment.msme.exporters_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"name\": {\n    \"en\": \"Exporters\"\n  },\n  \"content\": {\n    \"stage\": \"assessment\",\n    \"scope\": {\n      \"segments\": [\n        \"msme\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"business\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"export_invoices\",\n        \"documentTypes\": [\n          \"{{documentTypeKey}}\"\n        ],\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"when\": {\n          \"attr\": \"business.gst_registered\",\n          \"op\": \"eq\",\n          \"value\": true\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
      "options": {
        "raw": {
          "language": "json"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "event": [
